# API (`apps/api`)

Cargo workspace with crates `domain`, `application`, `infrastructure`, `mydrive-api` (presentation + binary).

- Add persistence or MinIO code only in `infrastructure`.
- Add HTTP/DTO/OpenAPI only in `presentation`.
- Sync matching logic lives in `domain::sync` and must stay I/O-free.
- Routes are versioned under `/v1`. mDNS type is `_mydrive._tcp`.
- Run `cargo test` from `apps/api` before finishing API work.
- Use `sqlx::query` / `query_as` (not macros that need a live DB at compile time) so CI can compile without Postgres.
